<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>THE AFRICAN QUANTUM — Trading Journal</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@700;800&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --bg:#07090d;--bg2:#0c0f15;--bg3:#111620;--border:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  --text:#d4dde8;--green:#00e599;--red:#ff4d6a;--mono:'DM Mono',monospace;--display:'Syne',sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;padding:40px;min-height:100vh;}
.container{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:30px;}
h1{font-family:var(--display);font-size:24px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;}
p{color:#7a8fa8;margin-bottom:20px;}
button{font-family:var(--display);background:var(--green);color:#07090d;border:none;padding:10px 20px;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <h1>THE AFRICAN QUANTUM</h1>
  <p>System initialized successfully. Ready for trading logs and execution tracking.</p>
  <button onclick="alert('System Operational!')">Test Connection</button>
</div>
</body>
</html>
